==Battleground==
*1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns.
**3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns.
**3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**2 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns.

==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4,]] this was the only [[Legend Stages|Legend Stage]] to use the [[Cats of the Cosmos]] meadow [[Backgrounds|background]].

